   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zamfara State Climate Change Adaptation and Agricultural Value Chain Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to contribute to poverty reduction and to strengthen the food and nutrition security of vulnerable populations in Zamfara state through sustainable development of Agricultural value chains. The project will support the government&#x2019;s efforts of enhancing rural micro-finance initiatives through the Financial Service Association (FSA). The project will support accelerated economic growth on a sustainable basis through various reform systems.</narrative>
